- RC = √(29²+167²)/√170 = √28730/√170 = √169 = 13 ✓

**Shoelace formula** (vertices in order R→B→P→C→Q→A):

| Edge | XᵢYᵢ₊₁ − Xᵢ₊₁Yᵢ |
|------|---------------------|
| R→B | 85·0 − 170·(−85) = 14450 |
